━━ beat 7 ─ Install asks: "save emails locally for speed?" → yes → local SQL tables hydrate
save emails locally for speed? (offer derived from: search, get) [Y/n] [scripted: yes]
  hydrated into local SQL: 24 emails, 24 stored
  the extent is a fact: _hydration.mailbox = {"emails":24,"stored":24,"from":"manifest-offer","heldUntil":0}
  every hydration fetch went through the measured capability — the first observed posteriors now exist
  ✓ acceptance holds

━━ beat 8 ─ office frame personalemail --maxtokens 2000 --duration 100s
  the FT frame:
  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  -- vended by sequence·v2 · session sgjdgxs0 · comments are courtesy; every load-bearing fact below is a statement
  
  narratives.team = "The mail crew is a four-person team that triages a shared support inbox covering invoices, renewals, releases, onboarding and retros. We answer within a day, star anything billing-related, archive aggressively, and never send from automation without a human in the loop. Escalations go to whoever is on point that week."
  narratives.self = "I am the developer on the mail crew who owns the billing label and the renewal follow-ups. I prefer terse, code-anchored summaries. I want agents to read and organize my personal mail — search it, fetch it, label it — but composing or sending mail stays with me; that boundary is permanent, not a phase."
  
  personalemail.get = (id: string) -> { from: string, subject: string, body: string, labels: string } ~survival(exp, OBSERVED)
  personalemail.get._description = "Fetch one of my messages. Team context: [[narratives.team]]"
  personalemail.get._reliability = { alpha: 25, beta: 1 }
  personalemail.get._validUntil = 1000100000
  
  personalemail.labels = () -> { labels: string }
  personalemail.labels._description = "My label taxonomy. Team context: [[narratives.team]]"
  personalemail.labels._validUntil = 1000100000
  
  personalemail.search = (q: string) -> { ids: [string] } ~survival(exp, OBSERVED)
  personalemail.search._description = "Search my personal mail. Owner: [[narratives.self]]"
  personalemail.search._reliability = { alpha: 3, beta: 1 }
  personalemail.search._validUntil = 1000100000
  
  _sessions.sgjdgxs0.expiresAt = 1000100000
  _sessions.sgjdgxs0.continue = (ft: string) -> { ok: boolean }
  _sessions.sgjdgxs0.expand = (token: string) -> { content: string, costTokens: number }
  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  ✓ acceptance holds

